{"title":"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) #2</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) #4</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Ground beef sells for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/3/ce3da6473208f0e7595cbdac956b7abd66b8aad4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$5.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> per kg. How much does <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> kg of ground beef cost?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/d/afd622d80bdbf44c0ebdb74ecf578eb180561480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\  \\$5.00 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\$12.00\\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\$60.00\\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\$17.00\\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\$2.40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"577\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To get the total cost of all the ground beef, we would need to multiply the amount of kilograms of ground beef by the cost for only one kilogram of ground beef. This means that we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/6/3268e7e516b96dbb1ed231869aee241a7aa027fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$5.00 \\frac{1}{kg} \\times 12 kg = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } \\$60.00}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"247\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>